<title>RUSSIA: Russian Aug oil output flat on July, slips yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Russian Aug oil output flat on July, slips yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russian crude oil output in August edged up 0.1 percent on July but was two percent below year-ago levels, State Statistics Committee comparative figures showed on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The committee released the following data for energy output, but provided no absolute figures for August,</p>
<p>			     RUSSIAN ENERGY OUTPUT</p>
<p>		     JAN-AUG 1996		 AUG 1996</p>
<p>		   (million tonnes)	    pct change</p>
<p>					    mth/mth		yr/yr</p>
<p> Crude oil	    195		 +0.1		  -2</p>
<p> Gas condensate	 5.6	     +2		    -6</p>
<p> Refined oil	  118		 -4		    -8</p>
<p> Gasoline		18.0	     -3		   -11</p>
<p> Diesel		  31.5	     -3		   -12</p>
<p> Heavy fuel oil	42.5	     -3		    -8</p>
<p>(mazut)</p>
<p> Lubricants	     1.6	     -3		   -11</p>
<p> Natural gas	  379		 -4		    -4</p>
<p>(billion cubic metres)</p>
<p>-- Peter Henderson, Moscow Newsroom +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
